<title>USA: Plains Resources completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Plains Resources completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plains Resources Inc said on Tuesday it completed the acquisition of all of Chevron Corp's interest in California's Montebello Field, and as a result raised its 1997 capital spending plan to $95 million.</p>
<p>That represents a 76 percent increase from 1996 capital spending, the company said.</p>
<p>Plains paid $25 million for the Montebello interest.</p>
<p>The field was producing about 800 barrels of oil per day from 55 wells.</p>
